        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-error-example",
        "moduleId": "processing-steps",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "常见错误示例",
        "markdown": "以下SQL错误分别在哪一步被发现？\n\n- `SELECT * FORM student`：词法分析通过，但**语法分析**会发现`FORM`不是合法关键字。\n- `SELECT * FROM studnet`：**语义检查**会发现表`studnet`不存在于数据字典中。\n- `SELECT age + name FROM student`：**语义检查**会发现`age`是数值型而`name`是字符串型，加法运算类型不兼容。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-steps"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-interpret",
        "moduleId": "methods-compare",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "解释方法",
        "markdown": "解释方法在每次执行SQL语句时，都完整地执行词法分析、语法分析、语义检查、查询优化和代码生成全过程。优点是实现简单，缺点是对重复执行的语句也重复编译，效率较低。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000698"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库管理系统",
                "解释方法"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11436,
              "lineEnd": 11445,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "99169b7a5036b919e07757e5f68682855f355d15c3e059ad36758f70b7be8ccf"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-precompile",
        "moduleId": "methods-compare",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "预编译方法",
        "markdown": "预编译方法在执行前先将SQL语句编译成内部表示并保存。当语句再次执行时，只需进行参数绑定和少量检查即可直接运行，显著提高了重复执行语句的效率。嵌入式SQL通常采用预编译方法。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000699"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库管理系统",
                "预编译方法"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11446,
              "lineEnd": 11468,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0004/images/b4d0133bf9d854fb5d1e9e8281d324bec9676dc6bf9c67fb80ddbf25f984575e.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "f3bdccfdf19c008b841d6e55aa4498e4022f5ec0f4b0cd9305a02a1cf4e78b6d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-compare",
        "moduleId": "methods-compare",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "两种方法对比",
        "markdown": "| 维度 | 解释方法 | 预编译方法 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 编译时机 | 每次执行 | 首次执行前 |\n| 重复执行效率 | 低 | 高 |\n| 实现复杂度 | 简单 | 较复杂 |\n| 适用场景 | 交互式查询、即席查询 | 重复执行的批处理、嵌入式SQL |",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-interpret",
            "textbook-precompile"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-exercise",
        "moduleId": "check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "方法选择练习",
        "markdown": "以下场景更适合使用哪种方法？\n\n1. 数据库管理员临时查询某张表的记录数。\n2. 银行每晚批量生成对账单，使用相同的SQL模板但日期参数不同。\n\n参考答案：1. 解释方法（一次性查询，无需预编译开销）；2. 预编译方法（重复执行，参数变化但结构固定）。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-interpret",
            "textbook-precompile",
            "model-compare"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
